  "name": "Dashel Stonefist surrenders reliably once beaten down (#7949)",
  "contract": [
    "The Missing Diplomat (1447): accepting from Dashel Stonefist (4961) turns him",
    "hostile with an invincibility floor at 1 HP, and at 0-15% health timed list",
    "496101 must run to completion (quest credit, evade, friendly faction).",
    "Beating him down within ~2s of accept used to drop that install silently while",
    "the accept list was still running, so the fight never ended. Row id 2 now",
    "paces refires past the list runtime and overrides a running list, and the",
    "evade ends the cycle. This scenario stages 1246, accepts 1447 natively, drops",
    "him to 1 HP, and proves the floor holds, the quest completes, and he stays",
    "out of combat (friendly, no re-aggro)."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 180000,
